{"page":{"id":"d4eea762-7c16-43cd-9973-d6667c20b17b","theme":"elder-scrolls","slug":"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil","title":"Cyrodiil","meta_title":"Cyrodiil (The Elder Scrolls) — place, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"Cyrodiil is the Imperial heartland of Tamriel, centered on the Imperial City and White-Gold Tower, and the setting of The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion.…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Heartland province of the Empire.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Tamriel</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Imperial City</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iv-oblivion\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Elder Scrolls</strong></a>, <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city/white-gold-tower\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>White-Gold Tower</strong></a> and <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/septim-empire\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Septim Empire</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How Cyrodiil connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Located In:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel\" class=\"entity-link\">Tamriel</a>\n            — Cyrodiil is a province of <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel\" class=\"entity-link\">Tamriel</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city\" class=\"entity-link\">Imperial City</a>\n            — The <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city\" class=\"entity-link\">Imperial City</a> is in Cyrodiil.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Contains:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iv-oblivion\" class=\"entity-link\">The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion</a>\n            — Oblivion is set in Cyrodiil.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls\" class=\"entity-link\">The Elder Scrolls</a>\n            — Cyrodiil is connected to <a href=\"/elder-scrolls\" class=\"entity-link\">The Elder Scrolls</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city/white-gold-tower\" class=\"entity-link\">White-Gold Tower</a>\n            — Cyrodiil is connected to <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city/white-gold-tower\" class=\"entity-link\">White-Gold Tower</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/septim-empire\" class=\"entity-link\">Septim Empire</a>\n            — Cyrodiil is connected to <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/septim-empire\" class=\"entity-link\">Septim Empire</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">3</span>\n        </summ