 set in Cyrodiil.</li><li>Cyrodiil is connected to The Elder Scrolls through shared lore.</li><li>Evidence around Cyrodiil is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Cyrodiil?</h2>\n    \n    <p>\n        Cyrodiil is the Imperial heartland of <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel\" class=\"entity-link\">Tamriel</a>, centered on the <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city\" class=\"entity-link\">Imperial City</a> and <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/nirn/tamriel/cyrodiil/imperial-city/white-gold-tower\" class=\"entity-link\">White-Gold Tower</a>, and the setting of <a href=\"/elder-scrolls/elder-scrolls-iv-oblivion\" class=\"entity-link\">The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion</a>.\n    </p>\n    \n    <p class=\"also-known-as\">\n        <strong>Also known as:</strong>\n        Imperial Province, Heartlands.\n    </p>\n\n</section>","word_count":372,"uniqueness_score":"0.6180"},"entity":{"id":"3aeef636-66a4-4d1b-b2c1-773a490885a3","name":"Cyrodiil","slug":"cyrodiil","type":"place","short_description":"Heartland province of the Empire.","description":"Cyrodiil is the Imperial heartland of Tamriel, centered on the Imperial City and White-Gold Tower, and the setting of The Elder Scrolls IV: Oblivion.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"elder-scrolls","aliases":["Imperial Province","Heartlands"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/elderscrolls/images/d/da/Cyrodiil.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20120729182503","image_source":"https://elderscrolls.fandom.com/wiki/Cyrodiil","image_credit":"Fair-use identification thumbnail via Fandom. Character / franchise art © Bethesda Softworks / ZeniMax (as applicable). Not free or redistributable artwork.","image_license":"fair_use","image_usage":"fair_use_identification","image_alt":"Identification thumbnail for Cyrodiil"},"connections":[{"id":"ac982fdf-2f05-49c2-a5c9-6cfb24f4b84f","relationship":"lo